directly to charity.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:46.400
NutritionFacts.org is a nonprofit,
science-based public service,

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:48.480
where you can sign up
for free daily updates

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:52.760
on the latest in nutrition research
via bite-sized videos and articles.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:54.520
Everything on the
website is free.

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:55.400
There’s no ads,

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.060
no corporate sponsorships,
no kickbacks.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.960
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:03.160
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:05.120
as a tribute to
my grandmother,

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:09.400
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

